# THE SYNCED COPY OF THE ARCADE'S WALLET IS COMPARED BYTE FOR BYTE.
#
# scripts/sync-arcade.mjs checks apps/web/src/arcade/ against
# C:\GIELINOR\arcade\web\ as BYTES, deliberately -- its header explains that a
# copy differing only in line endings is still a copy somebody will one day
# diff and be confused by. GIELINOR pins those files to LF (its own
# .gitattributes: "it deploys to Linux").
#
# This repo has no such pin and core.autocrlf is true on Windows, so a fresh
# checkout would rewrite every one of them to CRLF -- and `npm run build`,
# which runs the check first, would then fail on a tree nobody had touched.
# Pinning the synced directory is the whole fix; the rest of the repo keeps
# whatever it had.
apps/web/src/arcade/** text eol=lf
apps/web/scripts/sync-arcade.mjs text eol=lf
